1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,843
A clock with only four hours: nought, one, two, three.

2
00:00:04,843 --> 00:00:08,515
Start at two and move on three: you land on one.

3
00:00:08,515 --> 00:00:11,927
Start at three, move on one: back to nought.

4
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:14,192
Arithmetic that wraps round.

